WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:03.236
[SIREN]

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:05.938
NICK PATON WALSH: When the
blasts pause in rare quiet

00:00:05.971 --> 00:00:09.308
in Toretsk, there are
few blessings to count

00:00:09.341 --> 00:00:11.911
and most are bitter.

00:00:11.944 --> 00:00:15.415
One is here, a familiar
scene of private worlds

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:19.352
torn open by a Russian
rocket two days earlier.

00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:23.689
But a place that might persuade
you to believe in miracles.

00:00:23.722 --> 00:00:27.727
19 people were trapped up here
when rubble blocked the stairs.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:31.397
But somehow, not one of
them was even injured.

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:34.133
A fire brigade ladder
getting them all out.

00:00:34.166 --> 00:00:37.637
Not even survivors
like Natalia know how.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:39.238
- [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

00:00:39.271 --> 00:00:40.039 line:0%
INTERPRETER: A noise.

00:00:40.072 --> 00:00:41.808 line:0%
I blinked twice
and couldn't see.

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:44.677 line:0%
The balcony door flew
open and trash blew in.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:46.045 line:0%
I'm terrified of flames.

00:00:46.078 --> 00:00:47.814 line:0%
And I realized we're
on the seventh floor.

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.348
And it's collapsing.

00:00:49.381 --> 00:00:52.351
Then, someone screamed don't
come out as there's no way.

00:00:52.384 --> 00:00:53.252
It's a miracle.

00:00:53.285 --> 00:00:54.687
I can't call it anything else.

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:58.758
NICK PATON WALSH: As
Putin's fake referenda,

00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:01.761
just a few miles away,
threatened yet worse here.

00:01:01.794 --> 00:01:04.163
Just now, the
shelling has finally

00:01:04.196 --> 00:01:06.432
become too much for some.

00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:10.269
[BARKING]

00:01:10.302 --> 00:01:15.108
Rescuers are evacuating Nina,
73, after six months living

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:17.677
alone without water or help.

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:19.512
- [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

00:01:26.051 --> 00:01:28.254
NICK PATON WALSH: We're
told she's the last person

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:30.022
to leave her block.

00:01:30.055 --> 00:01:31.291
- [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:47.006
NICK PATON WALSH: Two days
ago, a rocket hit her building.

00:01:47.039 --> 00:01:50.776
Yet also magically, she
was unscathed and just

00:01:50.809 --> 00:01:53.579
sat here under the gaping hole.

00:01:53.612 --> 00:01:56.883
The lonely agony of the
struggle before this moment

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:58.551
lying around.

00:01:58.584 --> 00:02:02.288
The pictures of life left,
of her A-student daughter

00:02:02.321 --> 00:02:07.527
who died of meningitis, aged 40,
of the choices of what to leave

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:11.230
and what to take, of
how hard just eating,

00:02:11.263 --> 00:02:14.300
washing, and drinking has been.

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:17.970
Winter will rip through here.

00:02:18.003 --> 00:02:21.174
And this may be the last time
the lights go out on this home.

00:02:25.344 --> 00:02:28.548
She's taken to the courtyard
where dozens of similar agonies

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:29.582
are gathered.

00:02:29.615 --> 00:02:31.984
Waiting for the evacuation bus.

00:02:32.017 --> 00:02:35.955
Even after six months hell,
faces that know still worse

00:02:35.988 --> 00:02:40.026
is coming and that are baffled
by the heaviest question.

00:02:40.059 --> 00:02:41.127
Why?

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:42.762
- [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

00:03:15.294 --> 00:03:16.529
NICK PATON WALSH:
Elena is leaving.

00:03:16.562 --> 00:03:21.300
She does not know where to
with her three children.

00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:25.104 line:0%
- [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

00:03:30.743 --> 00:03:32.245 line:0%
- There are some [INAUDIBLE].

00:03:36.882 --> 00:03:45.124
- [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

00:03:45.157 --> 00:03:47.994
- [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

00:03:56.502 --> 00:03:59.205
NICK PATON WALSH: Then,
the guns pick up again.

00:03:59.238 --> 00:04:01.774 line:0%
Even in leaving, there's
a sense of urgency

00:04:01.807 --> 00:04:04.844 line:0%
because artillery firing
from near where we are.

00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:07.179 line:0%
Well, that's been responded
to by the Russians.

00:04:07.212 --> 00:04:08.614
And a shell landed over here.

00:04:08.647 --> 00:04:09.949
So they're trying to
get people on a bus

00:04:09.982 --> 00:04:12.018
as fast as they can to
get them out of here.

00:04:12.051 --> 00:04:15.655
- [NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

00:04:15.688 --> 00:04:17.556
NICK PATON WALSH: Dozens
of lives with everything

00:04:17.589 --> 00:04:20.926
left behind them and
nothing certain ahead.

00:04:20.959 --> 00:04:24.063
Nick Paton Walsh, CNN, Toretsk.

